{
  "id": "blood-feud",
  "name": "A blood feud",
  "about": "Someone who remembers a wrong swears to pay back whoever did it. Raids, war, a blood price or a broken house follow, depending on which house is stronger.",
  "kind": "revenge",
  "weight": 3,
  "cooldown": 10,
  "title": "The Feud of {wronged.seat}",
  "roles": {
    "wronged": {
      "rank": [
        "lord",
        "bannerman"
      ],
      "seat": true,
      "either": [
        {
          "remembers": "raided|betrayed|burned|humiliat|spurned|whipped|beheaded|denied me|stole|bought my|hanged|brought war|died in"
        },
        {
          "goal": "revenge"
        }
      ],
      "likes": {
        "traits": [
          "vengeful",
          "wrathful",
          "proud"
        ]
      }
    },
    "foe": {
      "rank": [
        "lord",
        "bannerman"
      ],
      "otherHouse": "wronged",
      "either": [
        {
          "namedBy": {
            "role": "wronged",
            "memory": "raided|betrayed|burned|humiliat|spurned|whipped|beheaded|denied me|stole|bought my|hanged|brought war|died in"
          }
        },
        {
          "opinionOf": [
            "wronged",
            "<",
            -30
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "home": {
      "town": true,
      "seatOf": "wronged"
    },
    "prey": {
      "town": true,
      "ownedBy": "foe",
      "notCapital": true
    },
    "kin": {
      "childOf": "wronged",
      "age": [
        16,
        45
      ],
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "fade": "Years pass, and {thread} is just a grudge old men talk about by the fire.",
  "onDeath": {
    "wronged": "oath-unpaid",
    "foe": "foe-dies"
  },
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "vow",
      "stage": "rising",
      "speaker": "wronged",
      "at": "home",
      "text": [
        "{wronged} of {wronged.house} swears before the gods that {foe} will pay for what was done. In the hall at {home}, people say the old wrongs out loud.",
        "In the hall at {home}, {wronged} cuts {wronged.his} palm over the fire and swears {foe} of {foe.house} is {wronged.his} enemy until death."
      ],
      "memory": {
        "wronged": "I swore an oath against {foe}. I won't die with it unpaid.",
        "foe": "Word came that {wronged} of {home} has sworn an oath against me."
      },
      "do": {
        "goal": {
          "wronged": {
            "kind": "revenge",
            "text": "make {foe} pay in blood"
          }
        },
        "opinion": [
          [
            "wronged",
            "foe",
            -20
          ]
        ]
      },
      "after": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "if": {
            "opinion": [
              "foe",
              "wronged",
              ">",
              0
            ]
          },
          "to": "blood-price"
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "any": [
              {
                "stronger": [
                  "wronged",
                  "foe",
                  0.8
                ]
              },
              {
                "trait": [
                  "wronged",
                  "brave|wrathful"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "to": "raid"
        }
      ],
      "patience": 2,
      "otherwise": "insults"
    },
    {
      "id": "insults",
      "stage": "rising",
      "speaker": "foe",
      "text": "Insults travel the roads between {home} and {prey}. A herald of {foe.house} is sent home from {home} with his beard cut off.",
      "do": {
        "opinion": [
          [
            "foe",
            "wronged",
            -10
          ],
          [
            "wronged",
            "foe",
            -10
          ]
        ]
      },
      "after": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "if": {
            "any": [
              {
                "stronger": [
                  "wronged",
                  "foe"
                ]
              },
              {
                "chance": 0.4
              }
            ]
          },
          "to": "raid"
        }
      ],
      "patience": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "raid",
      "stage": "crisis",
      "speaker": "wronged",
      "at": "prey",
      "text": [
        "{wronged.house}'s riders burn the barns outside {prey} at night. {foe} counts the dead at dawn.",
        "Men with no colours attack {prey} at harvest, burn the crops and drive off the cattle. Everyone knows they came from {home}."
      ],
      "memory": {
        "foe": "{wronged}'s men raided {prey} and burned the barns.",
        "wronged": "My riders burned {prey}. It's a start."
      },
      "do": {
        "raid": [
          "wronged",
          "foe",
          "prey"
        ]
      },
      "after": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "if": {
            "all": [
              {
                "stronger": [
                  "foe",
                  "wronged",
                  0.9
                ]
              },
              {
                "trait": [
                  "foe",
                  "wrathful|vengeful|proud|brave|ambitious"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "to": "war"
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "chance": 0.35
          },
          "to": "war"
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "trait": [
              "foe",
              "craven|content|patient|just"
            ]
          },
          "to": "blood-price"
        }
      ],
      "patience": 2,
      "otherwise": "uneasy"
    },
    {
      "id": "blood-price",
      "stage": "crisis",
      "speaker": "foe",
      "text": "{foe} sends a chest of silver to {home} as a blood price, with a letter that doesn't quite say sorry.",
      "after": [
        1,
        1
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "if": {
            "trait": [
              "wronged",
              "vengeful|wrathful|proud"
            ]
          },
          "to": "price-refused"
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "richer": [
              "foe",
              "wronged"
            ]
          },
          "to": "price-taken"
        }
      ],
      "patience": 1,
      "otherwise": "price-taken"
    },
    {
      "id": "price-refused",
      "stage": "crisis",
      "speaker": "wronged",
      "text": "{wronged} sends the chest back to {foe} full of ash and a dead crow.",
      "do": {
        "opinion": [
          [
            "foe",
            "wronged",
            -30
          ]
        ]
      },
      "after": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "if": {
            "stronger": [
              "foe",
              "wronged",
              0.7
            ]
          },
          "to": "war"
        }
      ],
      "patience": 1,
      "otherwise": "raid"
    },
    {
      "id": "price-taken",
      "stage": "resolution",
      "end": "resolved",
      "text": "{wronged} takes {foe}'s silver. Priests watch the blood price change hands between {wronged.house} and {foe.house}. The feud is over, but nobody forgets it.",
      "memory": {
        "wronged": "I took {foe}'s blood price. The feud is over, but I don't forget.",
        "foe": "I paid {wronged} a blood price to end the feud."
      },
      "do": {
        "pay": [
          [
            "foe",
            "wronged",
            60
          ]
        ],
        "opinion": [
          [
            "wronged",
            "foe",
            40
          ],
          [
            "foe",
            "wronged",
            30
          ]
        ],
        "truce": [
          "wronged",
          "foe",
          3
        ],
        "goal": {
          "wronged": {
            "kind": "peace",
            "text": "keep the peace I paid for in grief"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "war",
      "stage": "crisis",
      "speaker": "foe",
      "at": "home",
      "text": [
        "{foe} hits back: {foe.house} marches on {home}.",
        "The banners of {foe.house} come over the hills toward {home}. {foe} has had enough of night raids."
      ],
      "memory": {
        "wronged": "{foe} brought war to my gates at {home}.",
        "foe": "I marched on {home} to stop {wronged}'s raiding."
      },
      "do": {
        "war": [
          "foe",
          "wronged",
          "home"
        ],
        "warSize": 6
      },
      "after": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "if": {
            "not": {
              "holds": [
                "wronged",
                "home"
              ]
            }
          },
          "to": "fallen"
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "all": [
              {
                "alive": "kin"
              },
              {
                "chance": 0.35
              }
            ]
          },
          "to": "kin-falls"
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "stronger": [
              "wronged",
              "foe",
              1.0
            ]
          },
          "to": "turned-back"
        }
      ],
      "patience": 3,
      "otherwise": "weary"
    },
    {
      "id": "kin-falls",
      "stage": "crisis",
      "speaker": "wronged",
      "text": "{kin}, {kin.son} of {wronged}, is carried home to {home} on a shield after the fighting with {foe.house}.",
      "memory": {
        "wronged": "My {kin.son} {kin} died in the war with {foe}. I will have {foe.his} heart for it."
      },
      "do": {
        "die": {
          "who": "kin",
          "how": "I fell fighting {foe.house} outside {home}."
        },
        "opinion": [
          [
            "wronged",
            "foe",
            -40
          ]
        ]
      },
      "after": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "if": {
            "stronger": [
              "wronged",
              "foe",
              0.8
            ]
          },
          "to": "vengeance"
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "not": {
              "holds": [
                "wronged",
                "home"
              ]
            }
          },
          "to": "fallen"
        }
      ],
      "patience": 2,
      "otherwise": "weary"
    },
    {
      "id": "turned-back",
      "stage": "crisis",
      "speaker": "wronged",
      "text": "{foe.house}'s army breaks against the walls of {home}. {wronged} rides out over their dead.",
      "after": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "if": {
            "stronger": [
              "wronged",
              "foe",
              1.2
            ]
          },
          "to": "vengeance"
        }
      ],
      "patience": 2,
      "otherwise": "weary"
    },
    {
      "id": "vengeance",
      "stage": "crisis",
      "speaker": "wronged",
      "at": "prey",
      "text": "Now {wronged} takes the war to {foe}: the army of {wronged.house} lays siege to {prey}.",
      "do": {
        "war": [
          "wronged",
          "foe",
          "prey"
        ],
        "warSize": 7
      },
      "after": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "if": {
            "holds": [
              "wronged",
              "prey"
            ]
          },
          "to": "humbled"
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "not": {
              "holds": [
                "wronged",
                "home"
              ]
            }
          },
          "to": "fallen"
        }
      ],
      "patience": 3,
      "otherwise": "weary"
    },
    {
      "id": "humbled",
      "stage": "resolution",
      "end": "resolved",
      "speaker": "foe",
      "at": "prey",
      "text": "{prey} falls to {wronged.house}. {foe} kneels in the mud before {wronged}, and the feud is paid for in land.",
      "memory": {
        "foe": "{wronged} took {prey} from me and made me kneel. My children will hear about it.",
        "wronged": "I took {prey} from {foe}. I kept my oath."
      },
      "do": {
        "goal": {
          "wronged": {
            "kind": "power",
            "text": "hold what I took from {foe}"
          },
          "foe": {
            "kind": "revenge",
            "text": "take {prey} back from {wronged.house}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fallen",
      "stage": "resolution",
      "end": "failed",
      "speaker": "wronged",
      "at": "home",
      "text": "{home} falls to {foe.house}. So the feud ends with one house broken and the other no wiser.",
      "memory": {
        "wronged": "I lost {home} to {foe}. My oath cost me everything."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "uneasy",
      "stage": "rising",
      "text": "An uneasy quiet settles between {wronged.house} and {foe.house}. Both lords sleep with swords by their beds.",
      "after": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "if": {
            "chance": 0.4
          },
          "to": "raid"
        }
      ],
      "patience": 2,
      "otherwise": "weary"
    },
    {
      "id": "weary",
      "stage": "resolution",
      "end": "resolved",
      "text": "Neither house can stand to bury anyone else. Priests carry the King's peace between {home} and {prey}, and {wronged} and {foe} both sign it.",
      "memory": {
        "wronged": "I made peace with {foe} because there was no one left to bury.",
        "foe": "{wronged} and I made a peace neither of us wanted."
      },
      "do": {
        "truce": [
          "wronged",
          "foe",
          3
        ],
        "opinion": [
          [
            "wronged",
            "foe",
            15
          ],
          [
            "foe",
            "wronged",
            15
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "oath-unpaid",
      "stage": "resolution",
      "end": "failed",
      "text": "{wronged} dies with the oath against {foe} still unpaid. In {home} they say the oath passes to whoever holds the seat now.",
      "memory": false
    },
    {
      "id": "foe-dies",
      "stage": "resolution",
      "end": "resolved",
      "speaker": "wronged",
      "text": "{foe} dies before {wronged} can take revenge on {foe.him}. {wronged} drinks to it, but it tastes of nothing.",
      "memory": {
        "wronged": "{foe} died before I could repay {foe.him}. The gods took my revenge from me."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "one-banner",
      "stage": "resolution",
      "end": "resolved",
      "speaker": "wronged",
      "text": "{wronged} and {foe} now serve the same house. Whatever the oath said, {wronged.house} won't let its own bannermen fight each other, so {thread} is over by order.",
      "memory": {
        "wronged": "I serve the same house as {foe} now. My oath against {foe.him} was put away by order, not forgotten."
      },
      "do": {
        "truce": [
          "wronged",
          "foe",
          4
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "interrupts": [
    {
      "if": {
        "sameHouse": [
          "wronged",
          "foe"
        ]
      },
      "to": "one-banner"
    }
  ]
}
